# winget installer manifest template for GAL
# Placeholders:
#   {{VERSION}}          — exact GitHub Release tag (e.g. v0.1.0)
#   {{SHA256_WIN_X64}}   — SHA-256 of gal-{{VERSION}}-windows-x64.zip (from checksums.txt)
#   {{SHA256_WIN_ARM64}} — SHA-256 of gal-{{VERSION}}-windows-arm64.zip (from checksums.txt)
#
# Archive layout (flat; resolve_packaged_source_root() uses flat-layout strategy):
#   gal-{{VERSION}}-windows-x64.exe   ← binary (portable command alias)
